    "Oyster Bay L. I.",
    "Came out here",
    "in the afternoon;",
    "in the morning",
    "I visited poor",
    "Cattie[?].",
    "I owe everything",
    "I have and[?] am",
    "to Father; he",
    "did everything",
    "for me, and I",
    "nothing for him.",
    "I remember so well",
    "how, years ago, when",
    "I was a very weak,",
    "asthmatic child,",
    "he used to walk[?]",
    "up and down"
